    "description": "BASL reiterates 22nd Amendment requires referendum, urges Govt. to withdraw Bill",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/BASL-reiterates-22nd-Amendment-requires-referendum-urges-Govt-to-withdraw-Bill/56-795921",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
