    "chunk_text": "Further strengthening its leadership within the industry, AB Securitas has been a founding member of the Sri Lanka Security Services Providers Association (SLASSPA) since 2004 and an active member of the Industrial Security Foundation (ISF) since 2009, contributing to the advancement of professional standards within Sri Lanka\u2019s private security sector.\n\nThe National Business Excellence Awards (NBEA), the flagship awards program of the National Chamber of Commerce of Sri Lanka, recognises organisations that demonstrate world-class standards of excellence in organisational performance, innovation, sustainability, and corporate governance while making a significant contribution to Sri Lanka\u2019s socio-economic development. Winning the Gold Award at NBEA 2026 further strengthens AB Securitas\u2019 reputation as Sri Lanka\u2019s most trusted security partner, reflecting the company\u2019s enduring commitment to delivering world-class security and cash management solutions through innovation, professionalism, operational excellence, and an uncompromising focus on customer confidence. As AB Securitas continues to set new benchmarks for the industry, this recognition stands as a testament to the trust and credibility built over three decades - and an open invitation to organisations seeking a security partner they can rely on."
  },
