    "chunk_size_bytes": 1130,
    "chunk_text": "The centrepiece of the forum was a detailed presentation by the Port City Colombo team, delivered across three segments covering the broader Port City Colombo development story, land and real estate investment opportunities available within the SEZ and business setup proposition for companies considering establishing operations at Port City Colombo.\n\nThe presence of Sri Lankan banks in the Maldives - including Bank of Ceylon, Commercial Bank of Ceylon and Hatton National Bank - provided the Maldivian investors with a familiar and accessible business gateway into Port City Colombo.\n\nSignificantly, Commercial Bank of Ceylon has established a branch within the SEZ itself, offering the Maldivian businesses a direct banking channel through which to transact and operate within Port City Colombo.\n\nThe formal programme concluded with a vote of thanks delivered by CHEC Port City Colombo Assistant Managing Director Bai Xiaping.\n\nFrom left: CHEC Port City Colombo Deputy General Manager and Executive Director Land Development and Marketing Shalaka Wijeyaratne and CHEC Port City Colombo Assistant Managing Director Bai Xiaping"
